  "headline": "Metoclopramide hydrochloride is not on FDA's shortage list; supply traces to multiple registered plants with VAI inspections",
  "headline_cites": ["D3", "E7", "E12", "E17", "E23", "E25"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list does not include metoclopramide hydrochloride as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The product label (SPL set 95269b1f) identifies five registered plants for this NDC: ACM Pharma (FEI 3004177283, France), COSMA S.p.A. (FEI 3002806754, Italy), Intertek (FEI 3002807539, United Kingdom), Patheon France SAS (FEI 3004468553, France), and SGS France (FEI 3002807507, France).",
      "cites": ["E7", "E12", "E17", "E23", "E25"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection records show all five plants received VAI classifications at their most recent inspections: ACM Pharma on 2024-01-24, COSMA S.p.A. on 2022-06-17, Intertek on 2023-06-30, Patheon France SAS on 2023-09-29, and SGS France on 2024-01-19.",
      "cites": ["E3", "E4", "E5", "E6", "E8", "E9", "E10", "E11", "E13", "E14", "E15", "E16", "E18", "E19", "E20", "E21", "E22", "E24"]
    },
    {
      "text": "No FDA enforcement action (warning letter, import alert, or OAI classification) is recorded for any of these plants in the provided evidence.",
      "cites": ["E3", "E4", "E5", "E6", "E8", "E9", "E10", "E11", "E13", "E14", "E15", "E16", "E18", "E19", "E20", "E21", "E22", "E24"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 44 units with 4.9 days of supply at 8.9 units per day, while Corvale General holds 256 units with 29.1 days at 8.8 units per day.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The ranked transfer option moves 82 units from Corvale General to Corvale East, leaving the sender with 20 days of supply and bringing the receiver to 14 days.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Execute the transfer per pharmacy director approval to rebalance inventory across sites.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    }
  ]
}
